<title>GREECE: AMEX'S PAPAIOANNOU TO HEAD ALPHA CREDIT'S FX DESK.</title>
<headline>AMEX'S PAPAIOANNOU TO HEAD ALPHA CREDIT'S FX DESK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dimitris Papaioannou, formerly a senior forex dealer at American Express, Athens, took over as new chief forex dealer at private Alpha Credit Bank, market sources said.</p>
<p>Papaioannou who holds an engineering degree from Athens Polytechnic and an economics degree from the Athens University assumed his new duties officially today, the sources said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
